WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:06,420
Grandma Quan happened to call.

2
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:08,420
Aunt Lin is very capable.

3
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:11,080
You took away all the community resources

4
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:15,080
Coordinating financial resources is the job of the neighborhood committee. It’s a coincidence.

5
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:16,680
Our family is short of food

6
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:18,080
Send a batch over quickly

7
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:20,030
The statistics have not been completed

8
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,830
Unable to allocate at the moment

9
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:23,430
Don’t be careless

10
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:24,830
If you don’t take the initiative to send it to me

11
00:00:24,830 --> 00:00:28,710
I'll come and take it myself

12
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:31,110
I have to get my service funds back today

13
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:48,430
It looks good now

14
00:00:48,430 --> 00:00:50,230
Both sides are not good people.

15
00:00:50,230 --> 00:00:52,230
It happened to be a black and white scene.

16
00:00:52,230 --> 00:00:54,230
Record the whole process and send it to the group

17
00:00:54,230 --> 00:00:56,580
Everyone can see his true face
